Metric interpretation
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
answer_accuracy/entity_f1 : primary factual correctness
required_fact_coverage    : semantic coverage of validated facts
relation/path metrics     : reported only when explicit predictions exist
supported_claim_rate      : claims supported by benchmark facts/evidence
hallucination_rate        : unsupported generated claims
retrieval metrics         : canonical evidence matching
route accuracy            : reported only for Adaptive Hybrid
ROUGE-L/BERTScore         : supporting similarity metrics

